{"name":"Empress Envy","hex":"#2a9ca0","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"empress","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The female monarch (ruler) of an empire.","The wife or widow of an emperor or equated ruler."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Rare form of impress."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/empress"},{"term":"envy","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Resentful desire of something possessed by another or others (but not limited to material possessions). .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","An object of envious notice or feeling."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To feel displeasure or hatred towards (someone) for their good fortune or possessions.","To resentfully or discontentedly desire (something someone else has that one lacks)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/envy"}],"entries":[{"title":"Envy","blocks":[{"text":"Envy is an emotion which occurs when a person lacks another's quality, skill, achievement, or possession and either desires it or wishes that the other lacked it. Envy can also refer to the wish for another person to lack something one already possesses so as to remove the equality of possession between both parties."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg/330px-The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Envy"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg/500px-The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg/1280px-The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B